%S A400402 1,6,66,739,8627,104320,1292940,16317949,208857730,2703321712,
%T A400402 35311151176
%N A400402 Number of fixed polymarquises with n cells.
%C A400402 A marquis is a fairy chess piece which can move either to one of the four closest squares (like a wazir) or like a knight. A polymarquis is a set of square cells in the 2-dimensional grid, connected by marquis moves. As usual, fixed means that we only identify forms that are translations of each other; for one-sided forms (A400403), translations and rotations are identified; for free forms (A400404), translations, rotations, and reflections are identified.
%H A400402 <a href="/index/Pol#polyominoes">Index entries for sequences related to polyominoes</a>.
%Y A400402 Cf. A001168 (polyominoes), A030444 (polyknights), A400403 (one-sided), A400404 (free), A400998.
%K A400402 nonn,more,new
%O A400402 1,2
